              highlighted: ["ACD","ACB","CBA"],
              justifications: [{ ref: "I.13" }] },
            { text: "Similarly we can prove that the sum of the angles {BAC} and {ACB} is also less than two right angles, and so the sum of the angles {CAB} and {ABC|CBA} as well.",
